      "displayText": "拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳讓呱呱泡蛙見識一下人類的……\n見識一下<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的厲害吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B38B93547154716CE186D9898B8B584E004E0B4EBA985E768420262026000A898B8B584E004E0B00100003110000FF01014F6059B3768453B25BB35427FF0100100002011401890000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "讓牠再次見識到<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的厲害吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
