      "offsetInSection": 2536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B937260518D6B21898B8B58523000100003110000FF01014F6059B3768453B25BB35427FF0100100002011401890000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿2",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 2584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00320000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "果然厲害！看<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳在鷹架間奔馳的身影！\n遊戲場忍者，非<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳莫屬！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 2596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "679C713653B25BB3FF01770B00100003110000FF01014F6059B357289DF967B69593595499B376848EAB5F71FF01000A904A623258345FCD8005FF0C975E00100003110000FF01014F6059B383AB5C6CFF0100100002011401890000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呱哇。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 2688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "547154C730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "透過鷹架遊戲場，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳和呱呱泡蛙之間想必已經有牽絆了！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳乾脆讓這隻呱呱泡蛙成為夥伴吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 2696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "900F904E9DF967B6904A62325834FF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B3548C547154716CE186D94E4B959360F35FC55DF27D936709727D7D464E86FF0100100001BE00000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E7E81068B93901996BB547154716CE186D9621070BA59254F345427FF0100100002011401890000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呱哇喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
