      "offsetInSection": 2836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "63495230547154716CE186D94E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳讓我大飽眼福了！\n這就送<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳當作是神速過關的獎品吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 2856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B38B936211592798FD773C798F4E86FF01000A90195C31900100100003110000FF01014F6059B375764F5C662F795E901F904E95DC7684734E54C15427FF0100100002011401890000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "能有和寶可夢呱呱泡蛙不相上下的\n敏捷度，<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳真是堪稱最強！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我期待<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳和呱呱泡蛙一起\n把所有的鷹架遊戲場都過關喔！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 2944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "若要讓呱呱泡蛙成為夥伴，\n請先整理盒子。",
