      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳跑來跟我搭話，\n是想放棄了嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
